{
  "env": "prod",
  "account_id": "f011d0ee02b23cad26b4b38151b204ad",
  "zone": "yonedarepo.com",
  "workers_subdomain": "mlong-f01",
  "prefix": "yonedarepo-prod",
  "ref": "main",
  "secrets_file": "~/.config/yonedarepo/prod.env",
  "vars": {
    "origin": "https://yonedarepo.com",
    "ratelimit": "1001"
  },
  "check_instances": 4,
  "workers": [
    {
      "role": "superfan",
      "file": "wrangler.prod-superfan.jsonc",
      "notes": [
        "Production superfan: the same cheap-model watcher as wrangler.superfan.jsonc, receiving the",
        "production platform Worker's tail events (yonedarepo-prod-platform names it in tail_consumers),",
        "with its own ledger and a $1/day cap. The hourly watch needs the platform's Durable Object",
        "namespace, queue and container ids, which exist only after the first deploy, and",
        "cloudflare/superfan/config.ts watches only yonedarepo-platform-dev; until both change, it runs",
        "on tail events alone. Secrets, set from stdin (~/.config/yonedarepo/prod.env):",
        "CF_ANALYTICS_TOKEN  API token with Account > Account Analytics > Read only",
        "SUPERFAN_READ_TOKEN bearer for GET /findings, GET /status, POST /run",
        "Deployed first: the production platform names this Worker in tail_consumers."
      ],
      "secrets": [
        "CF_ANALYTICS_TOKEN",
        "SUPERFAN_READ_TOKEN"
      ],
      "ephemeral": false,
      "config": {
        "name": "{prefix}-superfan",
        "main": "superfan/index.ts",
        "compatibility_date": "2026-10-07",
        "workers_dev": true,
        "preview_urls": false,
        "observability": {
          "enabled": true
        },
        "triggers": {
          "crons": [
            "7 * * * *"
          ]
        },
        "vars": {
          "CF_ACCOUNT_ID": "{account_id}",
          "WATCH_SCRIPT": "{prefix}-platform",
          "WATCH_URL": "https://{prefix}-platform.{subdomain}.workers.dev",
          "TELEMETRY_SOURCE": "cloudflare",
          "SUPERFAN_MODEL": "mimo-v2.6-flash",
          "MIMO_TOKEN_PLAN_REGION": "sgp",
          "DAILY_CAP_MICROUSD": "1000000"
        },
        "secrets_store_secrets": [
          {
            "binding": "MIMO_KEY",
            "store_id": "3d9115d4fe864c54a792bcb790a763e3",
            "secret_name": "MiMo"
          },
          {
            "binding": "ZAI_KEY",
            "store_id": "3d9115d4fe864c54a792bcb790a763e3",
            "secret_name": "ZAI"
          }
        ],
        "durable_objects": {
          "bindings": [
            {
              "name": "LEDGER",
              "class_name": "SuperfanLedger"
            }
          ]
        },
        "migrations": [
          {
            "tag": "v1",
            "new_sqlite_classes": [
              "SuperfanLedger"
            ]
          }
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "role": "platform",
      "file": "wrangler.prod-platform.jsonc",
      "notes": [
        "Production platform Worker (yonedarepo.com): the same source platform as dev's",
        "(infra/envs/dev.json), with its own Durable Object namespaces, Artifacts namespace, R2, D1,",
        "queues, workflow, check containers and secrets. Browsers reach it through the agent Worker's",
        "/api/v1 proxy (PLATFORM service binding); api.yonedarepo.com is its own hostname (Custom",
        "Domain plus the exact route, which wins over the sites Worker's *.yonedarepo.com route);",
        "WEB_ORIGIN is where people approve device logins (/device). Secrets, set from stdin:",
        "OWNER_TOKEN  production owner credential (~/.config/yonedarepo/prod.env)",
        "VAULT_KEY    64 hex characters, shared with yonedarepo-prod-agents",
        "Placed next to the data (aws:us-east-1, R2 and CheckContainer in ENAM), batched landing.",
        "Check runs: one per invocation, up to check_instances (4) at once.",
        "Model checks call the review model with REVIEW_MODEL_KEY, the managed Z.ai key (Secrets Store",
        "secret ZAI), bound to the platform Worker itself; it never reads an agent-layer connection.",
        "The production superfan (wrangler.prod-superfan.jsonc) receives this Worker's tail events."
      ],
      "secrets": [
        "OWNER_TOKEN",
        "VAULT_KEY"
      ],
      "health": "yonedarepo-platform",
      "config": {
        "name": "{prefix}-platform",
        "main": "worker/platform-index.ts",
        "compatibility_date": "2026-10-07",
        "compatibility_flags": [
          "nodejs_compat"
        ],
        "limits": {
          "subrequests": 50000
        },
        "workers_dev": true,
        "preview_urls": false,
        "observability": {
          "enabled": true
        },
        "placement": {
          "mode": "targeted",
          "region": "aws:us-east-1"
        },
        "tail_consumers": [
          {
            "service": "{prefix}-superfan"
          }
        ],
        "assets": {
          "directory": "../frontend/dist",
          "binding": "ASSETS",
          "not_found_handling": "single-page-application",
          "run_worker_first": true
        },
        "vars": {
          "ARTIFACTS_NAMESPACE": "{prefix}",
          "LAND_MODE": "batch",
          "WEB_ORIGIN": "{origin}",
          "WORKERS_SUBDOMAIN": "{subdomain}"
        },
        "secrets_store_secrets": [
          {
            "binding": "REVIEW_MODEL_KEY",
            "store_id": "3d9115d4fe864c54a792bcb790a763e3",
            "secret_name": "ZAI"
          }
        ],
        "artifacts": [
          {
            "binding": "ARTIFACTS",
            "namespace": "{prefix}",
            "remote": true
          }
        ],
        "durable_objects": {
          "bindings": [
            {
              "name": "WORKSPACES",
              "class_name": "WorkspaceAuthority"
            },
            {
              "name": "SOURCE_REPOS",
              "class_name": "SourceRepository"
            },
            {
              "name": "CHECK_RUNNERS",
              "class_name": "CheckContainer"
            },
            {
              "name": "OBJECT_PUSHES",
              "class_name": "ObjectPushQueue"
            },
            {
              "name": "COMMIT_SHARDS",
              "class_name": "CommitShard"
            },
            {
              "name": "LAND_COMBINERS",
              "class_name": "LandCombiner"
            }
          ]
        },
        "migrations": [
          {
            "tag": "v1",
            "new_sqlite_classes": [
              "SourceRepository",
              "WorkspaceAuthority",
              "CheckContainer"
            ]
          },
          {
            "tag": "v2",
            "new_sqlite_classes": [
              "ObjectPushQueue"
            ]
          },
          {
            "tag": "v3",
            "new_sqlite_classes": [
              "CommitShard"
            ]
          },
          {
            "tag": "v4",
            "new_sqlite_classes": [
              "LandCombiner"
            ]
          }
        ],
        "containers": [
          {
            "class_name": "CheckContainer",
            "image": "./containers/Dockerfile",
            "image_build_context": "..",
            "instance_type": "standard-1",
            "rollout_step_percentage": [
              100
            ],
            "constraints": {
              "regions": [
                "ENAM"
              ]
            }
          }
        ],
        "r2_buckets": [
          {
            "binding": "OBJECTS",
            "bucket_name": "{prefix}-platform-objects"
          }
        ],
        "d1_databases": [
          {
            "binding": "INDEX",
            "database_name": "{prefix}-platform-index",
            "migrations_dir": "migrations"
          }
        ],
        "queues": {
          "producers": [
            {
              "binding": "PLATFORM_QUEUE",
              "queue": "{prefix}-platform-jobs"
            },
            {
              "binding": "PLATFORM_CHECKS",
              "queue": "{prefix}-platform-checks"
            }
          ],
          "consumers": [
            {
              "queue": "{prefix}-platform-jobs",
              "max_batch_size": 10,
              "max_batch_timeout": 1,
              "max_concurrency": 20,
              "max_retries": 3,
              "dead_letter_queue": "{prefix}-platform-dead-letter"
            },
            {
              "queue": "{prefix}-platform-checks",
              "max_batch_size": 1,
              "max_retries": 3,
              "dead_letter_queue": "{prefix}-platform-dead-letter"
            }
          ]
        },
        "workflows": [
          {
            "name": "{prefix}-platform-import",
            "binding": "PLATFORM_IMPORT",
            "class_name": "PlatformImportWorkflow"
          }
        ],
        "ratelimits": [
          {
            "name": "AUTH_LIMITER",
            "namespace_id": "{ratelimit}",
            "simple": {
              "limit": 30,
              "period": 60
            }
          }
        ],
        "services": [
          {
            "binding": "SELF",
            "service": "{prefix}-platform"
          }
        ],
        "routes": [
          {
            "pattern": "api.yonedarepo.com",
            "custom_domain": true
          },
          {
            "pattern": "https://api.yonedarepo.com/*",
            "zone_name": "yonedarepo.com"
          }
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "role": "agents",
      "file": "wrangler.prod-agents.jsonc",
      "notes": [
        "Production agent-layer Worker: the front of yonedarepo.com (frontend, agent API, remote MCP).",
        "It reaches only the production platform, through the PLATFORM service binding (`/api/v1` is",
        "proxied there on the same origin) and the WORKSPACES script binding. Its stores, containers",
        "and secrets are its own. Website previews are served by yonedarepo-prod-sites on",
        "apps.yonedarepo.com (SITE_ORIGIN); executable app previews (cloudflare/apps) are off, as on",
        "dev: APPS and APP_ORIGIN are unset.",
        "Only the cheap providers have keys (ZAI glm-5.3-flash, MiMo mimo-v2.6-flash); Codex and",
        "Claude have no binding and fail closed with PROVIDER_MISSING. MANAGED_PROVIDER_KEYS lets the",
        "owner bind those two store keys to a named account as managed connections",
        "(POST /api/admin/providers/managed). Secrets, set from stdin:",
        "OWNER_TOKEN  production owner credential (~/.config/yonedarepo/prod.env)",
        "VAULT_KEY    64 hex characters, shared with yonedarepo-prod-platform",
        "The sites Worker's `https://*.yonedarepo.com/*` route would otherwise win on www: on one",
        "hostname a route takes precedence over a Custom Domain, and the most specific route pattern",
        "wins. The apex is not matched by `*.`, so it needs no route.",
        "Sandbox runs (runtime sandbox-cli-v1): one AgentSandbox Durable Object per attempt starts",
        "sandbox/Dockerfile with Internet off; SandboxOutbound adds the provider key and the project",
        "token. Model requests go through the AI Gateway named in SANDBOX_AI_GATEWAY (custom",
        "providers custom-zai and custom-mimo; one-time setup in docs/runbook.md). The sandbox clones",
        "from SANDBOX_PLATFORM_ORIGIN."
      ],
      "secrets": [
        "OWNER_TOKEN",
        "VAULT_KEY"
      ],
      "health": "yonedarepo",
      "config": {
        "name": "{prefix}-agents",
        "main": "worker/agents-index.ts",
        "compatibility_date": "2026-10-07",
        "compatibility_flags": [
          "nodejs_compat"
        ],
        "limits": {
          "subrequests": 50000
        },
        "workers_dev": true,
        "preview_urls": false,
        "placement": {
          "mode": "targeted",
          "region": "aws:us-east-1"
        },
        "routes": [
          {
            "pattern": "yonedarepo.com",
            "custom_domain": true
          },
          {
            "pattern": "www.yonedarepo.com",
            "custom_domain": true
          },
          {
            "pattern": "https://www.yonedarepo.com/*",
            "zone_name": "yonedarepo.com"
          }
        ],
        "observability": {
          "enabled": true
        },
        "assets": {
          "directory": "../frontend/dist",
          "binding": "ASSETS",
          "not_found_handling": "single-page-application",
          "run_worker_first": true
        },
        "vars": {
          "PUBLIC_APP_ORIGIN": "{origin}",
          "ARTIFACTS_NAMESPACE": "{prefix}",
          "CODEX_MODEL": "gpt-5.6-luna",
          "CLAUDE_MODEL": "claude-sonnet-5-5",
          "MIMO_MODEL": "mimo-v2.6-flash",
          "ZAI_MODEL": "glm-5.3-flash",
          "STARTER_REPO": "yoneda-website-starter",
          "SITE_ORIGIN": "https://apps.{zone}",
          "MANAGED_PROVIDER_KEYS": "secrets-store",
          "SANDBOX_PLATFORM_ORIGIN": "https://{prefix}-platform.{subdomain}.workers.dev",
          "SANDBOX_AI_GATEWAY": "{account_id}/{prefix}"
        },
        "services": [
          {
            "binding": "SELF",
            "service": "{prefix}-agents"
          },
          {
            "binding": "PLATFORM",
            "service": "{prefix}-platform"
          }
        ],
        "secrets_store_secrets": [
          {
            "binding": "MIMO_KEY",
            "store_id": "3d9115d4fe864c54a792bcb790a763e3",
            "secret_name": "MiMo"
          },
          {
            "binding": "ZAI_KEY",
            "store_id": "3d9115d4fe864c54a792bcb790a763e3",
            "secret_name": "ZAI"
          }
        ],
        "artifacts": [
          {
            "binding": "ARTIFACTS",
            "namespace": "{prefix}",
            "remote": true
          }
        ],
        "durable_objects": {
          "bindings": [
            {
              "name": "REPOSITORIES",
              "class_name": "RepositoryAuthority"
            },
            {
              "name": "LIVE",
              "class_name": "LiveRoom"
            },
            {
              "name": "WORKSPACES",
              "class_name": "WorkspaceAuthority",
              "script_name": "{prefix}-platform"
            },
            {
              "name": "AGENT_SANDBOX",
              "class_name": "AgentSandbox"
            }
          ]
        },
        "migrations": [
          {
            "tag": "v1",
            "new_sqlite_classes": [
              "RepositoryAuthority",
              "LiveRoom",
              "ExecutionContainer",
              "SourceWorkspaceAuthority"
            ]
          },
          {
            "tag": "v2",
            "new_sqlite_classes": [
              "AgentSandbox"
            ]
          },
          {
            "tag": "v3",
            "deleted_classes": [
              "ExecutionContainer",
              "SourceWorkspaceAuthority"
            ]
          }
        ],
        "containers": [
          {
            "class_name": "AgentSandbox",
            "scheduling_policy": "durable_object",
            "images": {
              "agent": {
                "dockerfile": "./sandbox/Dockerfile",
                "build_context": ".."
              }
            }
          }
        ],
        "r2_buckets": [
          {
            "binding": "OBJECTS",
            "bucket_name": "{prefix}-agents-objects"
          }
        ],
        "d1_databases": [
          {
            "binding": "INDEX",
            "database_name": "{prefix}-agents-index",
            "migrations_dir": "migrations"
          }
        ],
        "queues": {
          "producers": [
            {
              "binding": "AGENT_QUEUE",
              "queue": "{prefix}-agents-agent"
            },
            {
              "binding": "CAPTURE_QUEUE",
              "queue": "{prefix}-agents-capture"
            },
            {
              "binding": "EVALUATE_QUEUE",
              "queue": "{prefix}-agents-evaluate"
            }
          ],
          "consumers": [
            {
              "queue": "{prefix}-agents-agent",
              "max_batch_size": 1,
              "max_retries": 3,
              "dead_letter_queue": "{prefix}-agents-dead-letter"
            },
            {
              "queue": "{prefix}-agents-capture",
              "max_batch_size": 1,
              "max_retries": 3,
              "dead_letter_queue": "{prefix}-agents-dead-letter"
            },
            {
              "queue": "{prefix}-agents-evaluate",
              "max_batch_size": 1,
              "max_retries": 3,
              "dead_letter_queue": "{prefix}-agents-dead-letter"
            }
          ]
        },
        "ratelimits": [
          {
            "name": "AUTH_LIMITER",
            "namespace_id": "{ratelimit}",
            "simple": {
              "limit": 30,
              "period": 60
            }
          }
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "role": "sites",
      "file": "wrangler.prod-sites.jsonc",
      "notes": [
        "Production website previews (cloudflare/sites): signed previews /v/<digest>/<token>/ and",
        "published sites /p/<repo>/, read from the agent Worker's bucket and authorized through its",
        "PLATFORM service binding. It takes over the hosts of the retired apps Worker",
        "(yonedarepo-apps-dev): apps.yonedarepo.com (the agent Worker's SITE_ORIGIN) and the",
        "`https://*.yonedarepo.com/*` route, so any subdomain without its own exact route answers",
        "here and fails closed with 404 (www, api, dev and api.dev keep exact routes; the apex is not",
        "matched). Unlike the apps Worker it serves no executable apps and no per-app preview-<hash>",
        "origins: preview content is isolated by its CSP sandbox (opaque origin), not by hostname."
      ],
      "secrets": [],
      "config": {
        "name": "{prefix}-sites",
        "main": "sites/index.ts",
        "compatibility_date": "2026-10-07",
        "compatibility_flags": [
          "nodejs_compat"
        ],
        "workers_dev": false,
        "preview_urls": false,
        "routes": [
          {
            "pattern": "apps.yonedarepo.com",
            "custom_domain": true
          },
          {
            "pattern": "https://*.yonedarepo.com/*",
            "zone_name": "yonedarepo.com"
          }
        ],
        "r2_buckets": [
          {
            "binding": "OBJECTS",
            "bucket_name": "{prefix}-agents-objects"
          }
        ],
        "services": [
          {
            "binding": "PLATFORM",
            "service": "{prefix}-agents"
          }
        ],
        "observability": {
          "enabled": true
        }
      }
    }
  ],
  "retired": {
    "notes": [
      "The Oct 14 single-Worker production (cloudflare/wrangler.jsonc layout) and its apps and sites",
      "Workers, from .local/deploy/production/platform.json and the old prod.json. Exact names only:",
      "the dev env is named yonedarepo-dev-* after the cutover, so no prefix may be used here.",
      "Its Durable Objects (and the ExecutionContainer app) go with the Worker; the Artifacts",
      "namespace has no delete, so prune empties it."
    ],
    "workers": [
      "yonedarepo-dev",
      "yonedarepo-apps-dev",
      "yonedarepo-sites-dev"
    ],
    "containers": [
      "yonedarepo-dev-executioncontainer"
    ],
    "queues": [
      "yoneda-dev-agent",
      "yoneda-dev-capture",
      "yoneda-dev-evaluate",
      "yoneda-dev-publish",
      "yoneda-dev-platform",
      "yoneda-dev-dead-letter"
    ],
    "d1": [
      "yonedarepo-dev-index"
    ],
    "r2": [
      "yonedarepo-dev-objects"
    ],
    "artifacts": [
      "yoneda-dev"
    ]
  }
}
